    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d536">

                <pb facs="0559" n="551" sameAs="frus:frus1939v05/pg551"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.3731/2138</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Cuba</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Wright</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 2356</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-08-31">August 31,
                        1939</date>.<lb/>[Received September 5.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to enclose herewith a
                    self-explanatory memorandum of my conversation with the President today, in
                    which I informed him of our compliance with his request that the date of the
                    announcement of our intention to suspend further negotiations for the
                    supplementary trade treaty be further extended until September 9th—together with
                    certain observations advanced by the President in connection with other matters
                    relative thereto.</p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">J. Butler Wright</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d536-a1.xml" xpointer="d536-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
